title Home Assistant: an error: unlocking the back door fails on the server ("Lock jammed"): a box at the bottom names it for 4 s
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO home

wait 1600
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
wait 700
expect text "Hall"
expect text "Back door"
tap "Back door"
wait 600
expect text "Unlock"
key enter
wait 300
expect text "Unlock Back door?"
key enter
wait 700
expect text "Could not unlock Back door: Lock jammed"
shot error-line
check error-line
expect noquit
